  "instructions": "For durable work, use chat_send with a stable request_id, then chat_result with task_id. For independent simultaneous tasks on one provider, use a different session_id for each conversation; reuse it for follow-ups. Each session owns a persistent browser tab. Reusing a request_id never resends. Never route user data to another provider without authorization. Browser sessions remain open and account rate limits stay shared. Legacy provider tools use the unmanaged tab and cannot mutate a page reserved by its managed task. The following routing guidance applies to legacy chatgpt_* tools: 默认保持专用浏览器和 ChatGPT 页面常驻，除非用户明确要求，否则绝不调用 chatgpt_close_browser。发送最小间隔 5 秒，对话变更最小间隔 5 秒，回答完成后再等 5 秒才切换；这些是下限，不保证免于限流。新建前的额外刷新当前关闭，由 CHATGPT_WEB_REFRESH_BEFORE_NEW_CHAT 控制。每次发送前仍刷新当前对话，并校验 URL、草稿和附件；检测到变化则停止。对话达到 40 轮或出现 maximum-length 错误时，原子发送会先读取完整 transcript 并归档到 C:\\Users\\jmwan\\.chatgpt-web-mcp\\conversation-context，再新建普通对话；直接 submit_prompt 则拦截。chat_send 和 chatgpt_send_message 未指定模型、思考强度或回答档位时选择并核验 GPT-6 和高；显式设置优先。chatgpt_route_new_chat 是仅在明确调用时生效的旧路由，其默认档位为“极高”。临时 Pro 身份探针默认停用。不得调用 chatgpt_probe_pro_identity，也不得用 requestPro=true 调用 chatgpt_route_new_chat；这些调用会在新建临时对话或发送测试消息前停止。"
